 "_": [
  "IA-P4·S4.1 T1 — the period evolution's hand fixture. Written BEFORE PeriodEvolution existed; the expected rows",
  "(expected-average.csv, expected-fifo.csv) are worked in README.md, never produced by the code under test.",
  "The window: from 2025-07-01 to as_of 2026-06-15 — twelve monthly periods (the last partial), four quarterly; the",
  "opening boundary is 2025-06-30. Home currency CZK. P1 reports in CZK (no setting), P2 in USD.",
  "What it exercises: average vs FIFO (P1's A sale takes one lot and part of another; B's two lots carry different",
  "EUR rates); a EUR-priced fund settled in CZK (B) and its exchange-rate split; EUR cash (P1's cash leg) and its",
  "revaluation; a portfolio reporting in USD (P2, every amount converted); a transfer-in without an amount (P1 A",
  "09-05, cost = the latest price on or before its day); a transfer-in with one (P2 E); a transfer-out (P1 A 04-15,",
  "at cost, no realized); a payout at par (P1 C 04-10); a month with no movements (2025-08 for P1); a period whose",
  "opening holds nothing (P2 before 08-12); a substrate correction pair (C 10-10: original + -rev dropped by the",
  "effective ledger, -rep kept); a Conseq storno pair across a month-end (A 02-26 buy, 03-03 reversal-of-buy: paired",
  "and dropped by PeriodInputs, while the door's own units carry the buy at 02-28); a never-priced instrument (E);",
  "units the ledger does not explain (D: the provider holds 500, the ledger only sold 200 — 700 held before the",
  "ledger began, taken at the opening market value, S4.1·D2); and a purchase still settling at the provider's",
  "valuation (A 06-10, inside the 20 days before 06-12: the provider's 700 against the ledger's 800 is no gap)."
 ],
